			"notes": "- Explosions leave a Traveler's Lectern and its book standing, while the blocks around it break as usual: TNT, creepers, end crystals, beds, respawn anchors, fireballs and wither skulls. A wither, the ender dragon and fire pass it without breaking it. Before, an explosion or a fire broke one and its book was lost or dropped.\n- `/setblock` in destroy mode leaves one standing too; an operator uses `/travelers_lectern destroy`, or breaks it by hand.\n\n## Download\n\nOne jar, `travelers-lectern-2.1.0.jar`, for every supported Minecraft version: 1.20 to 1.20.4, 1.21 to 1.21.11 and 26.1 to 26.3. It needs Fabric Loader and Fabric API."
		},
